Author: Connor Hoehn <connorhoehn@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 6 13:30:57 2026 -0400

    perf(server-ws): presence frames serialise on their own per-connection lane
    
    A slow presence set held the same socket's next chat send behind it
    (aws-agentcore capacity-latency 2026-10-06: send queue wait 2.9-3.2 s p95
    in soak). independentServices (default ['presence']) keeps order within
    each lane, chat/call frames still share one lane, close drains all lanes,
    and [] restores one lane.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

